stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Idle
    Idle: idle
    Idle: OLED amount and BLE READY
    Tap: tap
    Tap: one-shot receiver armed for 15 seconds
    Pending: pending
    Pending: invoice or consignment session active
    Settled: settled
    Settled: confirmed balances displayed
    Error: error
    Error: session cleared and operator informed

    Idle --> Pending: diagnostic command implemented
    Idle --> Tap: debounced press edge
    Tap --> Pending: exact chunk run accepted locally
    Tap --> Idle: 15 second timeout second press or connection failure
    Pending --> Settled: valid consignment and one confirmation
    Pending --> Error: CRC validation import or network failure
    Pending --> Idle: session timeout or disconnect
    Error --> Idle: clear session and resume advertising
    Settled --> Idle: next dock session

    note right of Pending
        Human confirmation occurs on Dock A before broadcast.
        Ambiguous sends are audited and never retried automatically.
    end note
